OpenSSL

Home page: https://openssl-library.org/

license: Apache License 2.0
license url: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

The selected LTS release is defined in `projects/versions.mk`.

Building:
- Android is configured with the architecture-specific OpenSSL target.
- `ANDROID_NDK_ROOT` and the NDK toolchain `PATH` are set for both configure
  and build steps, as required by OpenSSL's `NOTES-ANDROID.md`.
- Shared libraries are built because CPython's `_ssl` and `_hashlib` extension
  modules load them from the packaged sysroot at runtime.
- Command-line applications and documentation are omitted from the Android
  build because this project consumes the libraries only.
